{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":43.34000015258789,"text":"A few kilometers outside the city, towards Thermie, is a museum that works the opposite way round from the others. Here, nobody says, do not touch. The exhibits are machines and experiments you have to turn, push, or stand on to understand what they do. There is a domed planetarium where you lie back and watch the sky, and a hole with a huge screen for large-format films. There is a simulator that moves along with the picture. The technology museum shows machines that worked in Greek factories and fields 80 years ago, and robots standing next to them. The idea behind all of it is one thing. You do not learn an experiment by reading it, you learn it by doing it.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.3799999952316284},{"word":"few","start":0.3799999952316284,"end":0.6399999856948853},{"word":"kilometers","start":0.6399999856948853,"end":1.2000000476837158},{"word":"outside","start":1.2000000476837158,"end":1.7999999523162842},{"word":"the","start":1.7999999523162842,"end":2},{"word":"city","start":2,"end":2.240000009536743},{"word":"towards","start":2.5999999046325684,"end":2.859999895095825},{"word":"Thermie","start":2.859999895095825,"end":3.2799999713897705},{"word":"is","start":3.559999942779541,"end":3.799999952316284},{"word":"a","start":3.799999952316284,"end":4.039999961853027},{"word":"museum","start":4.039999961853027,"end":4.239999771118164},{"word":"that","start":4.239999771118164,"end":4.860000133514404},{"word":"works","start":4.860000133514404,"end":4.860000133514404},{"word":"the","start":4.860000133514404,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"opposite","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.539999961853027},{"word":"way","start":5.539999961853027,"end":5.900000095367432},{"word":"round","start":5.900000095367432,"end":6.059999942779541},{"word":"from","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.21999979019165},{"word":"the","start":6.21999979019165,"end":6.480000019073486},{"word":"others",